      "text": "Day 2 · Fly to Coca (30 minutes), lunch at Sacha’s house in town, then 2 hours by motorised canoe down the Napo River, a 30-minute walk through the forest and a paddle across Lake Pilchicocha to Sacha Lodge (arrival around 15:30–16:00). Swim in the lake, visit the butterfly house and, after dinner, take a night walk or a canoe ride to spot caimans. (B, L, D)",
